  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Decentralisering FN-organisationer</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joint Programme on Local Governance, JPLG I - Joint Programme on Local Governance, JPLG</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">At the level of the programmes overall objective (Local governance contributes to peace and equitable service delivery) the indicators relate to three intended outcomes:
&#x2022; Access to basic services improved; &#x2022; Political and social stability enhanced
For objective one (Communities have equitable access to basic services through local government) four outcomes were specified:
&#x2022; Policy framework guiding local service delivery established; &#x2022; Local government councillors perceived as legitimate representatives; &#x2022; Local governments have capacity to perform their designated functions; &#x2022; Local governments effectively performing their service delivery functions.
For objective two (Local governments are accountable and transparent) there were two outcomes to be assessed:
&#x2022; Community members (at district and village levels) able to hold their leaders and officials accountable; &#x2022; Community members are actively engaged in the planning and management of service delivery.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;rnyat st&#xf6;d till Joint Programme f&#xf6;r God samh&#xe4;llsstyrning och        S&#xe4;kerhet via UNDP.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Renewed support to the Joint Programme on Local Governance and        Security via UNDP.</narrative>
  </description>
